\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God of mercy, God of grace,
\par Show the brightness of Thy face;
\par Shine upon us, Saviour, shine,
\par Fill Thy Church with light divine;
\par And Thy saving health extend
\par Unto earth's remotest end.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Let the peoples praise the Lord;
\par Be by all that live adored;
\par Let the nations shout and sing
\par Glory to their Saviour King;
\par At Thy feet their tribute pay,
\par And Thy holy will obey.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Let the peoples praise Thee, Lord;
\par Earth shall then her fruits afford;
\par God to man His blessing give,
\par Man to God devoted live;
\par One in joy, and light, and love.
\par                               Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

